  isSwLanguage: 1
  m_text: 'Partial Flower Baskets: <link="https://captainskolot.itch.io/"><color=#3DA0FF><u>captainskolot
    @https://captainskolot.itch.io/</u></color></link>\n

    Partial Maps: <link="https://winlu.itch.io/"><color=#3DA0FF><u>winlu
    @https://winlu.itch.io/</u></color></link>, <link="https://verzatiledev.itch.io/"><color=#3DA0FF><u>verzatiledev
    @https://verzatiledev.itch.io/</u></color></link>, <link="https://aamatniekss.itch.io/"><color=#3DA0FF><u>aamatniekss
    @https://aamatniekss.itch.io/</u></color></link>, <link="https://kokororeflections.itch.io/"><color=#3DA0FF><u>kokororeflections
    @https://kokororeflections.itch.io/</u></color></link>\n

    Animals: <link="https://finalbossblues.itch.io/"><color=#3DA0FF><u>finalbossblues
    @https://finalbossblues.itch.io/</u></color></link>\n

    Fish-related Icons:
    <link="https://pixelodyssey.itch.io/"><color=#3DA0FF><u>PixelOdyssey @https://pixelodyssey.itch.io/</u></color></link>\n

    Skill
    Icons: <link="https://whisperltd.itch.io/"><color=#3DA0FF><u>whisperltd @https://whisperltd.itch.io/</u></color></link>\n

    Food
    Icons: <link="https://pixelodyssey.itch.io/"><color=#3DA0FF><u>PixelOdyssey @https://pixelodyssey.itch.io/</u></color></link>\n

    Miscellaneous
    Icons: <link="https://pixelodyssey.itch.io/"><color=#3DA0FF><u>PixelOdyssey @https://pixelodyssey.itch.io/</u></color></link>\n

    UI
    Resources: <link="https://www.gamedevmarket.net/member/pavelreem"><color=#3DA0FF><u>pavelreem
    @https://www.gamedevmarket.net/member/pavelreem</u></color></link>\n

    Crops:
    bluecarrot16, Daniel Eddeland (daneeklu), Joshua Taylor, Richard Kettering (Jetrel).
    Commissioned by castelonia. License: CC-BY-SA 3.0+ or GPL 3.0+. <link="https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-crops"><color=#3DA0FF><u>https://opengameart.org/content/lpc-crops</u></color></link>\n

    Sound
    Effects & Music: <link="https://wowsound.itch.io/"><color=#3DA0FF><u>wowsound
    @https://wowsound.itch.io/</u></color></link>, <link="https://magicsoundeffects.itch.io/"><color=#3DA0FF><u>magicsoundeffects
    @https://magicsoundeffects.itch.io/</u></color></link>, <link="https://elvgames.itch.io/"><color=#3DA0FF><u>ElvGames
    @https://elvgames.itch.io/</u></color></link>, <link="https://leohpaz.itch.io/"><color=#3DA0FF><u>leohpaz
    @https://leohpaz.itch.io/</u></color></link>\n\n

    If your work is missing
    from the credits, please contact me at <link="mailto:shanflyer@qq.com"><color=#3DA0FF><u>shanflyer@qq.com</u></color></link>.\n

    Thank
    you to everyone involved!

'
